<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line" lang="en-US">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Cache Management for Mixture-of-Experts LLMs
– extended version
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author"><span class="ltx_annotated_personname">
