<p id="S6.SS0.SSSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The artifact is available in the Zenodo repository<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib25" title="" class="ltx_ref">25</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
</section>
